   "snippet": "While researching BBQ spots from my perch outside of Austin, I happened upon Micklethwait by luck (and a solid social presence). This spot is different. It maintains the super friendly food truck \u201cvibe\u201d while offering a comfortable air conditioned in a quieter residential neighborhood. Meats are great (hard for me to see much separation from their competitors, TBH)\u2026it\u2019s their sides where they really pull ahead. Tons of house made, healthier veg-first options. And they are proud of seasonal ingredients use! I\u2019ll definitely be returning to this spot. Such a lucky find!",
   "extracted_snippet": {
    "original": "While researching BBQ spots from my perch outside of Austin, I happened upon Micklethwait by luck (and a solid social presence). This spot is different. It maintains the super friendly food truck \u201cvibe\u201d while offering a comfortable air conditioned in a quieter residential neighborhood. Meats are great (hard for me to see much separation from their competitors, TBH)\u2026it\u2019s their sides where they really pull ahead. Tons of house made, healthier veg-first options. And they are proud of seasonal ingredients use! I\u2019ll definitely be returning to this spot. Such a lucky find!"
